title: Fortios: Certificate Expiry
agents: special
catalog: network/fortigate
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the certificates on a Fortigate.
 It changes the status to {warn} or {crit} according to day limits configured.
 Default is {warn} 30 and {crit} 7.

 See details of the service to view all certificates

 Values can be parameterized using a rule. Also, which types of certificate we will monitor.

 The special agent is required for this check, 
 which can be configured via “FortiOS”.

discovery:
 One service is created for all certificates.